@ksampoh @malaysiakini @anthonyloke @JPJ_Malaysia @MOTMalaysia Totally legit ideas — but we need less policy talk, more practical action with urgency. My add-ons:
9. Mandatory seatbelts – on all bus seats, with strict enforcement.
10. Road safety upgrades – better signage, safer routes, emergency-ready hotspots.

